solve the level and that's not something I'd like to see.

If we go that way I'd leave the level as is in bones. Sometimes you get 
solved level, sometimes unsolved but solvable level and sometimes 
unsolvable[1] level. Should balance nicely. But some people would see 
them cheated if they cannot solve the problem themselves although I 
thionk that most players have memorized the solutions.

[1] With unsolvable I mean without using any of the methods leading to 
luck reduction.

